{
  "id": "31",
  "title": "论兄弟姊妹",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“论兄弟姊妹”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "比肩者，兄弟也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-3a3390d98d1c03e664e1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "且如，甲见甲为兄，乙为弟妹；寅卯亦然。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-713523642aea5170beeb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见庚则剋兄，见辛则伤弟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-7f397e4acd3414380a6c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲木旺相，兄姊争财；甲乙寅卯既多，则兄弟姊妹夺财不和，争斗是非。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-842be3c9226e8f79a0e9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见己合甲，兄姊不正。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-6bae7768fdc7afc11a61-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见庚，弟妹不正。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-767cca571760318daea9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "如见杀多，乙木得局，是杀合会乙木而伤甲；此兄不若弟之福，借弟之力而加恃。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-8c9644bb2ecce87421bb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲木寅月，乙木受制，主兄旺弟衰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-1f0e1b5e6d8595c70a52-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "其餘和顺不睦，但以八字休旺死绝推之，无不应验矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "31-862edba7032017fc2cb0-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
